<title>UK: BayerLB sets 500 million stg Eurobond.</title>
<headline>BayerLB sets 500 million stg Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CSFB and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN STG   COUPON     6.875     MATURITY    07.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.145   PAY DATE   S05.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.52     SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
